v {xschem version=3.4.7 file_version=1.2

* uvlo -- hierarchical-cell symbol for design/uvlo.sch. Per design/README.md,
* this symbol lives beside its schematic (not under design/symbols/) so
* xschem descends into uvlo.sch when this symbol is placed in a parent
* schematic (e.g. design/gate_driver_core.sch's x3 instance).
* Auto-generated from the schematic's ipin/opin instances with
* `awk -f <xschem>/make_sym.awk 300 uvlo.sch`; the only hand-added content
* here is this comment block -- regenerate (do not hand-edit pin geometry)
* if uvlo.sch's port list changes.
* Pin (B-line) order below fixes the derived netlist's .subckt port order:
*   VDD_DRV OUT GND_DRV
}
K {type=subcircuit
format="@name @pinlist @symname"
template="name=x1"
}
T {@symname} -36 -6 0 0 0.3 0.3 {}
T {@name} 285 -32 0 0 0.2 0.2 {}
P 4 5 280 -20 -280 -20 -280 20 280 20 280 -20 {}
B 5 -302.5 -12.5 -297.5 -7.5 {name=VDD_DRV dir=in}
L 4 -300 -10 -280 -10 {}
T {VDD_DRV} -275 -14 0 0 0.2 0.2 {}
B 5 297.5 -12.5 302.5 -7.5 {name=OUT dir=out}
L 4 280 -10 300 -10 {}
T {OUT} 275 -14 0 1 0.2 0.2 {}
B 5 -302.5 7.5 -297.5 12.5 {name=GND_DRV dir=in}
L 4 -300 10 -280 10 {}
T {GND_DRV} -275 6 0 0 0.2 0.2 {}
